BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:They Call Her Death
DTSTART:20250615T020000Z
DTEND:20250615T035500Z
DTSTAMP:20250615T020000Z
UID:3sR06BkLPU
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nOn the wild frontier of the Ameri
 can prairie\, Molly Pray is on a bloody crusade against the criminal force
 s that have wronged her. She shows no mercy\, leaving a trail of bodies in
  her wake on a mission that ultimately strikes at the heart of the America
 n identity and the notion of manifest destiny. But for Molly Pray—who ha
 s the embodied specter of death on her side—this isn’t political. This
  is personal.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/they-call-her-dea
 th
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
